WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.867
-Good evening, everybody.

00:00:01.867 --> 00:00:02.868
I'm Seth Meyers,
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:03.870
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.338
And now we are gonna
get to the news.

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:08.541
President Biden addressed the
UN General Assembly yesterday

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:11.243
and said that the Russian
invasion of Ukraine

00:00:11.243 --> 00:00:13.812
"is about extinguishing
Ukraine's right

00:00:13.812 --> 00:00:15.381
to exist as a state,"

00:00:15.381 --> 00:00:19.486
and nine out of 10 times,
I agree we shouldn't do that.

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:22.822
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.757
In the same speech,
President Biden addressed

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:26.192
the ongoing invasion in Ukraine

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:29.328
and said, "Russia has shamefully
violated the core tenets

00:00:29.328 --> 00:00:31.230
of the United Nations Charter,

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:33.233
not to mention the dress code.

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:35.000
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.203
Ukrainian President
Volodymyr Zelenskyy

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:39.805
addressed the
UN General Assembly yesterday

00:00:39.805 --> 00:00:41.373
in a pre-recorded speech,

00:00:41.373 --> 00:00:43.609
and it must have been
very pre-recorded,

00:00:43.609 --> 00:00:46.045
'cause he said,
"Everything's great."

00:00:46.045 --> 00:00:48.047
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:51.784
The House yesterday
voted 229 to 203

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:54.353
to overhaul
the Electoral Count Act.

00:00:54.353 --> 00:00:56.956
Though, somehow
that wasn't a majority.

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:59.659
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:03.563
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.898 --> 00:01:08.501
Always put math in the jokes.

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.503
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:12.472
People love to do that math.

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:14.774
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:17.943
President Biden issued
a major disaster declaration

00:01:17.943 --> 00:01:19.279
yesterday for Puerto Rico,

00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:22.482
but thankfully Governor DeSantis
is already sending help.

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:25.985
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:28.287
In an interview
on Fox News last night,

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:30.056
former President Trump defended

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:31.824
his handling
of sensitive materials

00:01:31.824 --> 00:01:35.328
and said that he had the power
to declassify documents

00:01:35.328 --> 00:01:37.096
"even by thinking about it."

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:38.130
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:39.465
Oh, great.

00:01:39.465 --> 00:01:42.168
So, on top of everything else,
Trump has The Shining.

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.236
Well...

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:45.104
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.104 --> 00:01:47.473
...that explains
his luck with hotels.

00:01:47.473 --> 00:01:49.875
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:52.278
In the same interview,
former President Trump claimed

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:55.180
that the agents who raided
his Mar-a-Lago home

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:59.251
took his will and said it could
"cause a lot of problems

00:01:59.251 --> 00:02:00.319
if it's published,"

00:02:00.319 --> 00:02:02.989
'cause not everyone
made the cut.

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:06.091
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.091 --> 00:02:09.695
A banner was raised
in Madison Square Garden

00:02:09.695 --> 00:02:10.997
last night celebrating...

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:12.432
[ Women cheering ]

00:02:12.432 --> 00:02:13.566
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:15.802
Get it out of your system.
He's not here.

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:17.203
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:20.173
He's not gonna see this.
He's not gonna know you cheered.

00:02:20.173 --> 00:02:21.974
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.974 --> 00:02:24.210
[ Laughs ]

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:28.313
And, by the way, buddy,
if you are watching,

00:02:28.313 --> 00:02:29.314
I'm so sorry I said that.

00:02:29.314 --> 00:02:30.749
We'd love to have you.

00:02:30.749 --> 00:02:33.352
If you're in your hotel
after a concert right now

00:02:33.352 --> 00:02:35.187
relaxing with "Late Night"
and you just saw that joke,

00:02:35.187 --> 00:02:36.021
I'm sorry.

00:02:36.021 --> 00:02:37.056
I didn't mean it, buddy.

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:38.257
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.257 --> 00:02:40.426
A banner was raised
in Madison Square Garden

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:43.395
last night celebrating Harry
Styles' 15 nights of concerts.

00:02:43.395 --> 00:02:45.999
"Plenty of room up there,"
said Knicks fans.

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:49.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.701 --> 00:02:53.239
World champs -- 1973.

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:54.440
Harry Styles.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:57.277
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.645 --> 00:03:00.613
Today was the first day of fall,

00:03:00.613 --> 00:03:04.984
and due to climate change, this
is how the leaves are changing.

00:03:04.984 --> 00:03:06.853
That was taken in Vermont.

00:03:06.853 --> 00:03:08.922
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.922 --> 00:03:10.690
And finally,
Taco Bell has announced

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:13.459
that it will begin testing
its new meatless carne asada

00:03:13.459 --> 00:03:16.462
next month at dozens
of locations in Dayton, Ohio,

00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:17.930
raising the question --

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:21.334
how many Taco Bells
does Dayton, Ohio, need?

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:23.035
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.035 --> 00:03:24.771
But true story --
I tried to book a flight

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:27.006
to Dayton today
after I heard this news,

00:03:27.006 --> 00:03:28.141
and they were available.

00:03:28.141 --> 00:03:30.677
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.677 --> 00:03:32.412
That was a monologue, everybody!

